   "source_ref": null,
   "body_md": "Dirk was marshal of [[testmark]]. He commanded the host at the [[battle-at-the-ford|Battle at the Ford]] and held [[eastbrook]] through the siege of YV 1021.",
   "html": "<p>Dirk was marshal of <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/testmark\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000010\" data-slug=\"testmark\">Kingdom of Testmark</a>. He commanded the host at the <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/battle-at-the-ford\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000040\" data-slug=\"battle-at-the-ford\">Battle at the Ford</a> and held <a class=\"wikilink\" href=\"/wiki/eastbrook\" data-entity=\"00000000-0000-7000-8000-000000000033\" data-slug=\"eastbrook\">Eastbrook</a> through the siege of YV 1021.</p>\n"
  },
